#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/flatpak-and-bubblejail.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Flatpak or Bubblejail stopped working after an update"
msgstr "Flatpak u Bubblejail na funcziunan betg pli suenter in’actualisaziun"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/flatpak-and-bubblejail.md
msgid ""
"Flatpak and Bubblejail apps ceased launching following a routine update on a "
"machine installed from the 0.9.3 medium. `bubblewrap-suid` no longer exists, "
"so the update replaced it, and unprivileged user namespaces are disabled on "
"such a system."
msgstr ""
"Suenter in’actualisaziun da rutina sin ina maschina installada cun il medium "
"da la versiun 0.9.3 han las applicaziuns da Flatpak e Bubblejail chalà da "
"s’aviar. `bubblewrap-suid` n’exista betg pli, perquai ha l’actualisaziun "
"remplazzà quest pachet, ed ils spazis da num da l’utilisader senza "
"privilegis èn deactivads sin in tal sistem."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/flatpak-and-bubblejail.md
msgid ""
"Check first that this is your situation: `sysctl "
"kernel.unprivileged_userns_clone` has to say `0`. If it says `1`, every "
"program already gets a user namespace and Flatpak has stopped for some other "
"reason. The guard would then take the namespaces away from every program "
"that is not on the list, and not every program survives that – see [A "
"Chromium-based program aborts](/troubleshooting/chromium-sandbox-helper/)."
msgstr ""
"Controllai l’emprim sche quai è Vossa situaziun: `sysctl "
"kernel.unprivileged_userns_clone` sto mussar `0`. Sch’el mussa `1`, survegn "
"mintga program gia in spazi da num da l’utilisader, e Flatpak è sa fermà per "
"in’autra raschun. Il guardian prendess lura davent ils spazis da num a "
"mintga program che n’è betg sin la glista, e betg mintga program surviva "
"quai – consultai [in program sin basa da Chromium interrumpa](/"
"troubleshooting/chromium-sandbox-helper/)."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/flatpak-and-bubblejail.md
msgid ""
"Install the guard, specify which executable is permitted to use one, and "
"switch it on:"
msgstr ""
"Installai il guardian, inditgai tge program exequibel che dastga utilisar in "
"spazi da num ed activai il guardian:"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/flatpak-and-bubblejail.md
msgid ""
"The first command updates the whole system, which on a machine that has not "
"been updated for a while can take long. Let it run to its end, as described "
"under [The terminal way](/troubleshooting/updating/#the-terminal-way)."
msgstr ""
"L’emprim cumond actualisescha l’entir sistem, quai che po durar ditg sin ina "
"maschina che n’è betg vegnida actualisada dapi in tschert temp. Laschai "
"terminar il process, sco descrit sut [La via dal terminal](/troubleshooting/"
"updating/#the-terminal-way)."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/flatpak-and-bubblejail.md
msgid ""
"The [0.9.4 release notes](/release-notes/0-9-4-beta/) explain why the "
"arrangement changed."
msgstr ""
"Las [remartgas davart la versiun 0.9.4](/release-notes/0-9-4-beta/) "
"explitgeschan pertge che quest arranschament è sa midà."
